e $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=7+3y,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=7+3y \\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number. \n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}7+3y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342000 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6e575bf2-282a-56e0-9c7b-f9d668c70fd8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -16 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340104} {:answer/id #uuid "81c756d9-3c31-59cb-a4e0-7950314357f1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340296} {:answer/id #uuid "a1613f2b-9f40-56d7-b338-827222fcc89f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340591} {:answer/id #uuid "ca5a603a-0d9e-53c5-965d-695328e8649e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340920} {:answer/id #uuid "ce31b1b2-1883-577c-b531-35a7f77096b8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -16 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340959}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "M∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340920} :answer-field/id #uuid "d185127d-bb7a-5f18-8d05-fdf27c7419f1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341748}] :